  "notes": "Phanpy's distinctive timeline: posts are 32px-radius white cards on #f0f2f5, no visible action row (reply/boost/like/save hidden behind '…' popup), tiny colored corner icons show your own liked/boosted/saved state, boosted posts get a faint purple gradient wash in the top-left with a rocket icon. Threads are visually stitched with a vertical line and collapsed middle posts labeled 2/X, 3/X in amber pills. Avatars are gradient initials circles. Alt text is printed as captions under media; multi-image posts use a grid with numbered ALT buttons. Filtered posts collapse to a thin row. Feed ends with 'The end.'. Below ~12,000px the virtualized list renders blank placeholder cards. A fixed round blue compose FAB sits bottom-right (no codebook entry for FAB)."
